 monthly Cool Teams program open to anyone interested in turning climate co
 ncern into collective action! Beginning on March 25th\, sessions will be h
 eld from 6 pm to 7:30 pm on the last Wednesday of each month. This month's
  session will be held alongside our gorgeous Petaluma Slough at the barn a
 t Steamer Landing Park. If you've been unable to implement our program in 
 the past due to HOA&nbsp\;restrictions\, difficult neighborhood locations\
 , lack of time\, or the demands of leadership\, now is your chance to part
 icipate. Don't miss out on this special opportunity to connect with like-m
